<title>UK: Eurotunnel could pay first div. in 10 yrs.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel could pay first div. in 10 yrs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc said a strong operating performance could allow it to pay out a first dividend within the next ten years.</p>
<p>Eurotunnel made the statement in an announcement detailing plans for the restructuring of its debt.</p>
</text>
